        "__v": 0,
        "_id": "599badb12d4c7455551c4ef7",
        "background": "#333",
        "content": "<div>\n    <lightimg src=\"https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/codex-content/uploads/images/ark.png\" bg=\"black\" width=\"4001\" height=\"4229\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"indents\">\n    <p>Polia,</p>\n    <p>We saw these scraps on a whiteboard—the one before the room—I mean outside it—I gathered or collected all that was possible: <em>(x,y)</em></p>\n    <p>\n        (14,54) You know a little basket can be found in a chimney or the reeds. And we will keep that chimney clear or hew those reeds as a collective good / (35,24) The particle-set of the leaves will flutter off the tree when the request is filled / (20,43) Not everyone can do this! / (17,90) August Bank Holiday Island? / Our lack of ourness (maybe areness) / (53,53) Problem with using is the User / (15,110) The boundary of this truce \n    </p>\n    <p>\n        (A placeholder: \"most people are fools—most authority is malignant—God does not exist—and everything is wrong\")\n    </p>\n</div>",
